  Description		  "Automotive Suspension \n\nThis demo describes a sim"
"plified half-car model that includes an independent\nfront and rear vertical "
"suspension. The model also includes body pitch and\nbounce degrees of freedom"
". The demo provides a description of the model to\nshow how simulation can be"
" used for investigating ride characteristics. \nIn conjunction with a powertr"
"ain simulation, the model could\ninvestigate longitudinal shuffle resulting f"
"rom changes in throttle setting.\n"
